<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech RPIX index closes down 1.2 pts at 1,039.4.</title>
<headline>Czech RPIX index closes down 1.2 pts at 1,039.4.</headline>
<text>
<p>1200 GMT - The Reuters RPIX index rebounds near the end of Wednesday's Prague Stock Exchnage session, but still closes lower.</p>
<p>*RPIX index down 1.2 points, or 0.12 percent, at 1,039.4.</p>
<p>*CEZ rises five crowns to 920</p>
<p>*Komercni Banka, Chemopetrol, SPT Telecom all lose slight ground.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
